{"n": 840, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "840.webp", "text": "41-\n\n4135291 REPLACING RIGHT REAR\nSIDE PANEL (PARTIAL\nREPLACEMENT UP TO\nWINDOW LINE)\n\n— Four Door Model —\n\nRefer to information on page 41 - 001.\nRemove or disconnect following parts:\ncomplete trunk trim panels, trunk lid seal, rear\nbumper, right tail tights, upper tail panel plate,\nspare wheel, rear seat cushion and backrest,\nhatrack, rear window with rubber frame,\nentrance cover strip with cover plate, roof\nliner partially, carpet partially, rear seat belt,\nrear door edge guard, door striker, C pillar\nplate, rear wheel, wheel house cover, expansion\ntank, fuel tank, brace mounting parts,\n\nMake cutting line for partial replacement.\nCut through side panel along cutting line up\nto the end plate.\n\nCaution!\n\nDon’t damage or bend the end plate.\n\nNote:\n\nMake cutting line in such a manner that roof\njoint paint finish can be touched up.\n\nUncover and drill out spot welds.\n\n325\n\n<5 Remove brazing solder.\n\nDrill out spot welds.\n\nUncover and drill out spot welds.\n\nCut out side panel along tine,\n\nCut side panel off of tail panel along line.", "words": [["41-", 0.4701, 0.0199, 0.5056, 0.0438], ["4135291", 0.2604, 0.061, 0.3085, 0.0723], ["REPLACING", 0.3232, 0.061, 0.386, 0.0729], ["RIGHT", 0.3911, 0.0617, 0.425, 0.0729], ["REAR", 0.4296, 0.0617, 0.4595, 0.0729], ["SIDE", 0.3227, 0.0782, 0.347, 0.0889], ["PANEL", 0.3516, 0.0782, 0.3875, 0.0889], ["(PARTIAL", 0.3916, 0.0782, 0.4433, 0.0895], ["REPLACEMENT", 0.3232, 0.0942, 0.4048, 0.1048], ["UP", 0.4088, 0.0942, 0.422, 0.1048], ["TO", 0.426, 0.0942, 0.4402, 0.1048], ["WINDOW", 0.3227, 0.1101, 0.3693, 0.1207], ["LINE)", 0.3728, 0.1101, 0.4022, 0.122], ["—", 0.3232, 0.132, 0.3298, 0.134], ["Four", 0.3343, 0.126, 0.3566, 0.1379], ["Door", 0.3607, 0.1267, 0.3845, 0.1379], ["Model", 0.388, 0.1267, 0.4169, 0.1379], ["—", 0.4215, 0.1326, 0.4276, 0.1346], ["Refer", 0.2609, 0.1592, 0.2862, 0.1698], ["to", 0.2908, 0.1605, 0.3004, 0.1698